flowchart LR
    subgraph Normal[普通 Parent Job]
        direction TB
        P[普通 Parent Job] --> A[Child async A]
        P --> B[Child launch B]
        A --> AF[A 执行失败]
        AF --> D[异常保存在 Deferred]
        D --> Await["调用 await()"]
        Await --> Throw[异常重新抛出]
        Throw --> PF[未捕获：Parent scope 失败]
        PF --> Cancel[B 被取消]
    end

    subgraph Supervisor[supervisorScope]
        direction TB
        S[supervisorScope] --> SA[Child async A]
        S --> SB[Child launch B]
        SA --> SD[A 失败：先不自动取消 B]
        SD --> SAwait["await() 后由调用方决定是否捕获"]
        SAwait --> SFail[未捕获：scope 仍会失败]
        SAwait --> SHandle[捕获并处理：B 可继续]
    end
